  "handoff": {
    "summary": "Pinned a network-free 12-curve corpus spanning probable ranks 0-5, exact coefficient digests, root signs, leading derivatives, GRH-conditional zero-sum regressions, nonminimal/additive models, and conductor stress. Added one-process Sage/PARI and Magma adapters, factorial normalization for Magma's Taylor coefficients, timing-boundary documentation, baseline validation, and an explicit lcalc capability skip.",
    "risks": [
      "Magma 2.18-5 is proprietary, optional, and uses a coarse CPU timer; ordinary CI must allow its explicit unavailable record.",
      "No standalone lcalc executable is installed. The probe deliberately refuses to count lcalc until coefficient sufficiency is recorded and validated.",
      "pnpm test:changed passed architecture checks but its broad unit tier failed in the unrelated all-baselib-modules-have-stable-Python-identity test on the shared concurrent host; the lane-specific oracle, Sage, syntax, JSON, and diff checks pass.",
      "The legacy elliptic benchmark could not start because this documentation/oracle worktree had no FLINT addon. Its cold native dependency rebuild was terminated to avoid duplicating a concurrent integration build; pnpm test:native remains for the integration lane."
    ],
